  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to inform policy and programme in Turkey via evidence-based needs assessment as well as to the provision of gender-responsive protection and livelihood support to strengthen the resilience of Syrian and host community women and to enhance gender-responsive efforts and support.</narrative>
